      (property "Description" "First ordinary watchdog supply-gate stage. Its 11-14 NO contact is in series with KWD2 before SR1:A1 and is not in an E-stop input loop. A welded or internally bypassed contact can defeat only this diagnostic stage, not bridge S0. Ordinary relay, not force-guided and not safety-rated; no PL/SIL credit. Received terminal identity, 2.5 W steady/0.5 A 5 ms PNOZ supply-load switching, polarity, continuity, wear and fault tests remain open." (at 0.00 0.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (hide yes)))
